#: tmainform.note.caption
msgid "TTyIconFont/TTyCharImage: point FontFile at an icon .ttf (such as FontAwesome), set FontFamily to its family name, then render vector icons via a name→codepoint map. On the left it tries to render a star (★) with the system symbol font; the family differs per platform, so the result may vary."
msgstr "TTyIconFont/TTyCharImage:把 FontFile 指向图标 .ttf(如 FontAwesome)、FontFamily 设为其族名,再用 name→codepoint 映射即可渲染矢量图标。左侧尝试用系统符号字体渲染一个星形(★),不同平台字体族不同,显示效果可能不一。"

